Scope note (not part of the license terms above)

This license covers the source code in this repository only. It does not cover
the datasets used in the paper or anything derived from them (pose sequences,
labels, k-means targets, model weights): BdSLW60, BdSLW401, BdSLW102a, WLASL,
LSA64, AUTSL, KArSL, GSL, LSFB-ISOL, MINDS-Libras, WL-BISINDO, ASL Citizen,
NTU RGB+D, HMDB51, UCF101 and FineGym each keep their own license or data-use
terms. Obtain them from their owners. The archived run logs and analysis
outputs under results/ and docs/ contain only accuracies and derived summary
statistics.
